w><row r="2" ht="80.5" customHeight="1"><c r="A2" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>RID-JOB-001</t></is></c><c r="B2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Job Assignment</t></is></c><c r="C2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>View and accept a job</t></is></c><c r="D2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Use Case Testing</t></is></c><c r="E2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Rider 1 (Active, Online, 0 active jobs). Seller 1 has a COD order for P-02 to ADDR-1 (total &#8369;500.00) marked Ready for Pickup. The job is offered to Rider 1.</t></is></c><c r="G2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Open the offer.
2. Check the details.
3. Click Accept.</t></is></c><c r="H2" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="I2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>The offer shows pickup (Seller 1, Commonwealth, QC), drop-off area (Brgy. Central, QC), COD &#8369;500.00 and pay &#8369;30.00 pickup. After Accept, the job is Assigned to Rider 1 and Logistics 1 sees Rider 1 as the assignee.</t></is></c><c r="J2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A10, A33</t></is></c><c r="K2" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L2" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M2" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="3" ht="42.25" customHeight="1"><c r="A3" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>RID-JOB-002</t></is></c><c r="B3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Job Assignment</t></is></c><c r="C3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Decline a job</t></is></c><c r="D3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Use Case Testing</t></is></c><c r="E3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Medium</t></is></c><c r="F3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Rider 1 (Active, Online, 0 active jobs). A job is offered; Rider 2 is Online.</t></is></c><c r="G3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Click Decline.</t></is></c><c r="H3" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="I3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>The offer disappears for Rider 1 and is offered to Rider 2. Rider 1 is not assigned.</t></is></c><c r="J3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A14</t></is></c><c r="K3" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L3" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M3" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="4" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A4" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>RID-JOB-003</t></is></c><c r="B4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Job Assignment</t></is></c><c r="C4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Offer timeout</t></is></c><c r="D4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Boundary Value Analysis</t></is></c><c r="E4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Rider 1 (Active, Online, 0 active jobs).</t></is></c><c r="G4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. On one offer, click Accept at 55&#8211;59 seconds.
2. On another offer, wait 61 seconds and click Accept.</t></is></c><c r="H4" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="I4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>The first Accept succeeds. After 60 seconds the second offer is expired; Accept is disabled or rejected and the job goes to the next rider.</t></is></c><c r="J4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A14</t></is></c><c r="K4" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L4" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M4" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="5" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A5" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>RID-JOB-004</t></is></c><c r="B5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Job Assignment</t></is></c><c r="C5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Job goes to Unassigned after 3 declines</t></is></c><c r="D5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>State Transition</t></is></c><c r="E5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Medium</t></is></c><c r="F5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Riders 1 and 2 and one more rider are Online.</t></is></c><c r="G5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Each of the 3 riders declines the same job in turn.
2. As Logistics 1, open the Unassigned queue.</t></is></c><c r="H5" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="I5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>After the 3rd decline the job is in the Unassigned queue and no longer offered automatically.</t></is></c><c r="J5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A14</t></is></c><c r="K5" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L5" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M5" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="6" ht="67.75" customHeight="1"><c r="A6" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>RID-JOB-005</t></is></c><c r="B6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Job Assignment</t></is></c><c r="C6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Accept and manual assignment at the same moment</t></is></c><c r="D6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Error Guessing</t></is></c><c r="E6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Rider 1 (Active, Online, 0 active jobs). A job is offered to Rider 1. Rider 2 is Online with 0 jobs.</t></is></c><c r="G6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. At the same moment, Rider 1 clicks Accept and Logistics 1 manually assigns the job to Rider 2.
2. Check both riders' job lists and Logistics 1's view.</t></is></c><c r="H6" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="I6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Exactly one rider has the job, and Logistics 1 shows that same rider. The other side gets a clear 'already assigned' message. No duplicate job exists.</t></is></c><c r="J6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A37</t></is></c><c r="K6" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L6" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M6" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="7" ht="42.25" customHeight="1"><c r="A7" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>RID-JOB-006</t></is></c><c r="B7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Job Assignment</t></is></c><c r="C7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Concurrent job limit</t></is></c><c r="D7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Boundary Value Analysis</t></is></c><c r="E7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Rider 1 (Active, Online, 0 active jobs). Rider 1 has 2 active jobs.</t></is></c><c r="G7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Accept a 3rd job.
2. Logistics 1 runs auto-assign and tries manual assign for a 4th job to Rider 1.</t></is></c><c r="H7" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="I7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>The 3rd is accepted. Rider 1 gets no 4th offer, and manual assign of a 4th is blocked.</t></is></c><c r="J7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A14</t></is></c><c r="K7" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L7" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M7" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="8" ht="29.5" customHeight="1"><c r="A8" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>RID-JOB-007</t></is></c><c r="B8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Job Assignment</t></is></c><c r="C8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Cannot accept another company's job</t></is></c><c r="D8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Error Guessing</t></is></c><c r="E8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Rider 1 (Active, Online, 0 active jobs).</t></is></c><c r="G8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Send an accept request with a job ID belonging to Logistics 2.</t></is></c><c r="H8" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="I8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Rejected (403 or not found). The job is unchanged.</t></is></c><c r="J8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A22</t></is></c><c r="K8" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L8" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M8" s="5" t="n"></c></row></sheetData><autoFilter ref="A1:M8"/><conditionalFormatting sqref="L2:L200"><cfRule type="cellIs" priority="1" operator="equal" dxfId="0"><formula>"Pass"</formula></cfRule><cfRule type="cellIs" priority="2" operator="equal" dxfId="1"><formula>"Fail"</formula></cfRule><cfRule type="cellIs" priority="3" operator="equal" dxfId="2"><formula>"Blocked"</formula></cfRule></conditionalFormatting><dataValidations count="1"><dataValidation sqref="L2:L200" showDropDown="0" showInputMessage="0" showErrorMessage="0" allowBlank="1" type="list"><formula1>"Pass,Fail,Blocked,Not Run"</formula1></dataValidation></dataValidations><pageMargins left="0.75" right="0.75" top="1" bottom="1" header